  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following two statements:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> : If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is an odd number, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> : If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is a prime number, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is an odd number.<br /><br />If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is the truth value of the contrapositive of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is the truth value of contrapositive of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> equals"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Contrapositive of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is not divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is not odd number<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math><br /><br />Contrapositive of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is not odd number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is not a prime number&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
}